* `interviewer` role

## Standard

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/interviewer/questions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer INTERVIEWER_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "jobTitle": "Customer Success Manager",
    "difficultyTier": "Standard"
  }'
```

Expected:

