# 6. SECURITY TESTS

## Missing Token

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/interviewer/questions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "jobTitle": "Backend Engineer"
  }'
```

Expected:

```text
401
```

---

## Invalid Token

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/interviewer/questions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer invalid-token" \
  -d '{
    "jobTitle": "Backend Engineer"
  }'
```

Expected:

```text
401
```

---

## Candidate Accessing Interviewer Endpoint

Use:

```bash
Authorization: Bearer CANDIDATE_TOKEN
```

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/interviewer/questions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer CANDIDATE_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "jobTitle": "Backend Engineer"
  }'
```

Expected:

```text
403
```

---

## Interviewer Accessing Candidate Endpoint

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/candidate/questions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer INTERVIEWER_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "jobRole": "Backend Engineer"
  }'
```

Expected:

```text
403
```

